    const options=selected=>[...new Set(choices)].map(role=>`<option value="${role}" ${role===selected?"selected":""}>${/^color\d+$/.test(role)?`Theme color ${role.slice(5)}`:role.replace(/([A-Z])/g," $1")}</option>`).join("");
    controls.innerHTML=`<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" data-header-use-theme ${enabled?"checked":""} ${required?"disabled":""}> Use theme colors</label>${enabled?`<div class="header-theme-roles"><label>Background<select data-header-theme-role="background">${options(bindings["header.background"]||"headerBackground")}</select></label><label>Text<select data-header-theme-role="color">${options(bindings["header.color"]||"headerText")}</select></label></div>`:""}`;
    panel.querySelectorAll('[data-header="background"],[data-header="color"]').forEach(input=>input.disabled=enabled);
  }
  function renderVisualTypography(){
